   "text": "Kizhi（キリ）療法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2c274be6580554149cdc",
   "sourceHash": "2c274be6580554149cdc93c0f9bce0fbc87185f0bb42569a42184d26ff1c9caa",
   "text": "：この療法ではハーブの湿布を用いて、痛みを和らげ、関節の可動性を高め、体の浄化を助けます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3ab7fac3da12e483e982",
   "sourceHash": "3ab7fac3da12e483e982180d26b77ed680db8cd15bb830574449e7c298b560fc",
   "text": "Kizhi（キリ）療法：この療法ではハーブの湿布を用いて、痛みを和らげ、関節の可動性を高め、体の浄化を助けます。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
